{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The agent-committer's sweep (its 5-minute timer; runnable by hand). For each repo in runtime/agent/commit-repos.json: never commit on master/main (branches-always), yield to dev.git autocommit (a repo still flagged there is shadowed - never two drivers), group the dirty tree into store units via dev.git.store_status, compose ONE message per unit via compose_message (LLM + fallback), commit each with dev.git.commit_unit, then push once per repo only when the branch tracks an upstream with unpushed work (unpublished branch reported, never published). Clean tree / git-less box / absent registry = free no-op. Takes NO params - timers fire with empty args. Returns {swept, units_committed, commits, pushed, results}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse crate::agent::committer::compose_message::compose_message;","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"qjqlvj1a101918b6fx1a81","readers":[],"time":1791027770611,"username":"system","writers":[]}